note left of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com3 
This configuration switch 
defines, whether the priority
of events at this component 
shall be ignored.
end note

note left of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7 
Dem General 
configuration 
overview
end note

note right of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com1 
This container contains the 
configuration parameters and 
subcontainers of the Dem 
module supporting multiple 
configuration sets.
end note

note left of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com
This container configures the 
monitored components
and system dependencies.
end note

note right of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com4
This container contains the
configuration (parameters)
for events.
end note

note left of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com5
Specifies the priority 
within the component.
A lower value
means higher 
priority.
end note

note left of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com6
Specifies the status 
within the component.
If this is set to false,
any diagnostic events 
for this component 
will be ignored.
end note

note right of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com7
Specifies the status 
of the event.
If this is set 
to false,
the event will be 
considered
unavailable.
end note

note left of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com8
Unique identifier of a 
diagnostic event, 
automatically 
generated by Dem
The events 
should be
sequentially 
ordered 
beginning with 
1 and
no gaps in between.
end note

note left of e_0277b6f617e3495b88ce33bd037c51b7_com9
Specifies the kind of 
the diagnostic event.
end note